### Get all attendance records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance
Accept: application/json

###
### Create attendance
### Change empId/attendanceDate combination before re-running to avoid unique constraint conflicts.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "empId": 1,
  "attendanceDate": "2026-04-22",
  "attendanceStatus": "present",
  "lateMinutes": 0,
  "overtimeHours": 1.50,
  "remark": "test create attendance"
}

###
### Update attendance
### Replace 1 with the actual attendanceId returned by GET/POST.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/6
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "empId": 1,
  "attendanceDate": "2026-04-22",
  "attendanceStatus": "late",
  "lateMinutes": 10,
  "overtimeHours": 2.00,
  "remark": "test update attendance"
}

###
### Delete attendance
### Replace 1 with the actual attendanceId you want to delete.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/6
Accept: application/json
